          "intent": "Let the key annual metrics feel alive as they enter view \u2014 each number a civic proof point that validates the shelter's work and invites continued investment.",
          "eyebrow": "This Year at Haven & Paw",
          "headline": "Measured Progress, Year After Year",
          "subheadline": null,
          "body": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "1,847",
              "description": "Animals rescued this year from abandonment, injury, or overcrowded municipal facilities.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "1,412",
